  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Arial, sans-serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14.6667px; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposal would have an adverse impact on street parking conditions and highway safety, contrary to Policy T3 of the London Plan 2021 Policy T3 and Policy LP43 of the Hackney Local Plan 2033.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-b6c12d08-7fff-038f-bf68-5485be76fd04&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;In the absence of adequate marketing evidence having been submitted to justify the loss of the industrial floorspace, demonstrating that there is no demand, the development would conflict with Policy LP28 Part D of the Hackney Local Plan 2033 (2020).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
